  "description": "“Heartless,” former humans devoid of emotions, have turned the world and Jemyeong Han’s life upside down. Jemyeong, now facing termination over an unresolved Heartless case, turns to Heartless hunting company 4K for help. But it's not long before he's inextricably entangled with its problematic co-CEO, Guk. “What if you start wanting me over everything?” Those sappy words belong to a webnovel prince, not a shameless man like you! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
